{
  "page": "thps2_recomp.html",
  "header": [
    "Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 2's regular plan for play_page.mjs, 2-3 minutes with every timeout counted: Load ROM in the page's",
    "picker, A on the Expansion Pak notice, START through the legal text and the logos to the main menu, then A through",
    "CAREER MODE, NEW CAREER, the first skater and his menu to the level select and The Hangar's goals, each press repeated",
    "until the word at 0x800FD5AC, which counts the front end's screens, moves, then A until the run starts (gRunActive,",
    "0x800DBF70, is 1), and 80 s of The Hangar with the default keys: pushing on, turns each way, ollies, a flip and a grab,",
    "and the pause menu once. Its waits and holds in the level are on the game's frame counter (0x800F5854, 30 a second of",
    "the game's time), so each browser gives the game the same input for the same game time."
  ],
